Rule 5 (input tensor is not empty)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 6 (input tensor has valid shape dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 0 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 9 (input and output tensors must have same shape)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= shape(v_1) = shape(v_2)
